                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6fa67b4-0329-328e-b259-ff4b23031865",
                                        "entry_id": "7b91e812-d7eb-3964-b2b7-c536f4319333",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A father who is the main caregiver of the children and is generally the homemaker of the household."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2519efcd-49f4-4019-8170-8e58d15d1aeb",
                                                "sense_id": "e6fa67b4-0329-328e-b259-ff4b23031865",
                                                "text": "On that note, are any of us guys prepared to have our wives be the sole breadwinners? As one stay-at-home dad said: “I feel funny buying my wife $40 worth of roses with her money.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
